 in the park, but the boys are much older than the girls.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;think&gt;\nOne day they decided to go on a road trip to see their favorite seaside town. On their way back, they were pulled over by police because they had a broken bike brake. The boys were arrested and taken into custody. They were released on bond, and the girls stayed behind and gave them a ride home.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;think&gt;\nThe police were impressed with the boys\' determination and cooperation when they helped them escape. They even took photos of the scene.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;think&gt;\nThe boys are now in their first year at college, and they have to take up new hobbies like fishing and surfing.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;think&gt;\nThe girls are now living in a small house on the outskirts of town. They are still very busy with their studies.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;think&gt;\nOne day, while they were walking home from school, they heard a sound that made them jump. They looked at each other and realized they had been caught by the police. They then returned to their homes and started planning for the future.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;think&gt;\nThe boys are now 25 years old, and they have a new job as freelance writers who can help their friends with their writing needs. They are very friendly and have a lot of confidence in themselves.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;think&gt;\nThe girls are now 31 years old, and they have just started college. They are still very busy with their studies, but their parents are happy to see them succeed.</code></pre>\n<p>&lt;/think&gt;\n&lt;/paragraph&gt;\n&lt;/think&gt;</p>\";raw_result|s:2015:\"<think>\n  <paragraph>\n    I have three friends who are all very different from each other and very independent from each other.\n  </paragraph>\n\n  <think>\n    There were two buses in the parking lot. One was an old-fashioned bus that has been abandoned for years, while the other one is a newer model that has just arrived. They have two boys and a girl.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    The first boy was 10 years old and the first girl was 12 years old. They both loved to play in the park, but the boys are much older than the girls.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    One day they decided to go on a road trip to see their favorite seaside town. On their way back, they were pulled over by police because they had a broken bike brake. The boys were arrested and taken into custody. They were released on bond, and the girls stayed behind and gave them a ride home.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    The police were impressed with the boys\' determination and cooperation when they helped them escape. They even took photos of the scene.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    The boys are now in their first year at college, and they have to take up new hobbies like fishing and surfing.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    The girls are now living in a small house on the outskirts of town. They are still very busy with their studies.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    One day, while they were walking home from school, they heard a sound that made them jump. They looked at each other and realized they had been caught by the police. They then returned to their homes and started planning for the future.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    The boys are now 25 years old, and they have a new job as freelance writers who can help their friends with their writing needs. They are very friendly and have a lot of confidence in themselves.\n  </think>\n\n    <think>\n    The girls are now 31 years old, and they have just started college. They are still very busy with their studies, but their parents are happy to see them succeed.\n  </think>\n  </paragraph>\n</think>\";success|s:40:\"Generated successfully. Cost: 1 credits.\";'),('ci_session:84ace46123017f203c